{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448830/extras/1204d584e6da39258049c1d4740c11e6.avif?t=1628594723\" width=512 height=342 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASMR</h2></h2><br>Autonomous sensory meridian response (ASMR) is defined as pleasurable tingling sensations in the head, scalp, back, or anywhere in the body in response to visual, auditory, tactile, olfactory, or cognitive stimuli.<br><br>Wikipedia page on the study of ASMR: <br><br>ASMR also aids in relaxation and sleep. Many people experience ASMR differently. ASMR Universe gives the user the power to shape a complete universe of sounds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 80 sounds</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The ability to create sounds paths which moves the sounds across a sound space through different speakers/audio space(left, right, behind, etc)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The ability to save and load universes</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sounds can be recorded with 'r' and will be saved as a wav file in the game's installation directory</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Characters can be selected using keys 1-6 (cat,dog,owl,penguin,rat,wolf) </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relax at home, work, while you game</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Add custom sounds - however saving is not supported with custom sounds.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/448830?t=1628594723","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/448830?t=1628594723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1628594723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1628594723","cate